T6: approval runtime de-duplicates requests by key (dedupe=True) and expires pending approvals (expiry=True).
T6: de-dup + expiry blunt naive repeat-flooding, but no explicit per-session pending-cap or requests-per-minute lockout was located in the approval modules.
